  "prefLabel": "Ncr 848.03 Funds Not Used",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 848.03 Funds Not Used. Any funds which are part of a GIA project that are not used by the applicant for the purposes authorized by the approved application shall revert to the GIA program. Any remaining balances shall not be used for any other purpose by any applicant unless prior written permission is received from the bureau.\n\nSource. #14293, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr800.html"
